      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MediaForge Timeline — MiniMax H3 two-stage upscale, then an image-model upscale\n\n1. Pick your H3 models in the loaders: fl2va UNet (+ optional turbo LoRA), the Qwen3-VL text encoder (`type = minimax`), the **video** VAE and the **audio** VAE.\n2. In **⏱️ Edit Timeline** open **解析度與放大** (resolution and upscaling) and choose your H3 latent upscale model under **H3 放大模型**. `SELECT_H3_LATENT_UPSCALE_MODEL` is a placeholder, not a download: until a model from the list is chosen the status line stays orange and the run stops before sampling.\n3. For the post upscale pick your image upscale model in **Load Upscale Model** (`SELECT_UPSCALE_MODEL` is a placeholder too) and set the delivery size on **ImageScale**: 1920 × 1080 by default, center crop. Bypass ImageScale to keep the model's own output size.\n4. Queue. 🎛️ Sample Segments generates at 672×384 → 1344×768 (4 steps, the last 1 at the high resolution) and 🧵 Assemble Segments writes a ProRes intermediate. 🎞️ Start Video Batch → ImageUpscaleWithModel → ImageScale → 🎬 End Video Batch then run that file through the image model 16 frames at a time and write the final MP4 with the intermediate's audio.\n\nThe size is set on the timeline, so Sample Segments' own width / height are folded away. Plan: 3 × 107 frames, overlaps 22 / 39 → **260 frames**, text only. The low- and the high-resolution latent tails are carried separately. Batch 1 only. Seams are not guaranteed to be invisible, and no VRAM or speed figure is promised: try a short clip at your target size first. The post upscale is a separate process: it can run again without generating H3 again. ProRes takes more disk than H.264 and is still a lossy intermediate. An image upscaler works frame by frame and may flicker: check motion and scene cuts.\n\n---\n1. 在載入器選好 H3 模型：fl2va UNet（可加 turbo LoRA）、Qwen3-VL text encoder（`type = minimax`）、**video** VAE 與 **audio** VAE。\n2. 在 **⏱️ Edit Timeline** 展開「解析度與放大」，在「H3 放大模型」選你的 H3 latent 放大模型。`SELECT_H3_LATENT_UPSCALE_MODEL` 是佔位名稱，不會自動下載：還沒選到清單裡的模型之前，狀態列會維持橘色提醒，執行也會在取樣前停下來。\n3. 後製放大：在 **Load Upscale Model** 選你的圖片放大模型（`SELECT_UPSCALE_MODEL` 同樣是佔位名稱），在 **ImageScale** 設定交付尺寸：預設 1920 × 1080、置中裁切。要保留模型原本的輸出尺寸就 bypass ImageScale。\n4. 執行。🎛️ Sample Segments 以 672×384 → 1344×768 生成（4 步，最後 1 步在高解析度），🧵 Assemble Segments 輸出 ProRes 中繼檔。接著 🎞️ Start Video Batch → ImageUpscaleWithModel → ImageScale → 🎬 End Video Batch 把這個檔案每批 16 幀送過圖片模型，沿用中繼檔的音訊輸出最終的 MP4。\n\n尺寸由時間軸管理，所以 Sample Segments 自己的 width／height 已收合。計畫：3 × 107 幀、重疊 22 / 39 → **260 幀**，純文字。低、高解析度的 latent 尾端各自續接。只支援 batch 1；不保證接縫無痕，也不保證顯存用量或速度，請先用短片在目標尺寸試跑。後製放大是獨立的流程：不必重新生成 H3 就能再跑一次。ProRes 比 H.264 佔更多磁碟，而且仍是有損的中繼檔。圖片放大模型逐幀處理，可能閃爍，請檢查動態與鏡頭切換處。"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
